  <h2>Making a logo with the Minecraft Title Generator</h2>
  <p>The quickest way to make a Minecraft style logo is the <a href="https://mctitlegenerator.com/" target="_blank">Minecraft Title Generator</a>. Type your text, pick a font and texture, and render your title as a PNG or SVG, all for free and right in your browser.</p>
  <p>Open the generator at <a href="https://mctitlegenerator.com/app/" target="_blank">mctitlegenerator.com</a>, or start from one of the shared <a href="https://mctitlegenerator.com/app/presets" target="_blank">presets</a> made by other people.</p>
  <p>If none of the fonts fit your logo, you can draw your own in the <a href="https://mctitlegenerator.com/font-editor/" target="_blank">Font Editor</a> and use it in the generator straight away.</p>
