  <h2>Using it in Blockbench</h2>
  <p>The title generator started out as a Blockbench plugin, and the plugin is still available. It is an older version and is missing a lot of what the website can do, but it builds your title as a real model, so you can move any letter, paint over the textures and render it from any angle.</p>
  <p>To use it, install Blockbench for free from <a href="https://blockbench.net/" target="_blank">blockbench.net</a>, then get the <a href="https://ewanhowell.com/plugins/minecraft-title-generator/" target="_blank">Minecraft Title Generator plugin</a> and follow this tutorial.</p>
